"You ask her how you should even go about it."
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"Umm...
	[/page]Maybe apologize to her?
	", 
	"Mei", spr_mei_portrait_uncomfortable_smile
);

obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
"[slant]Ok, let me try..."
);

